    {
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "嗨！好久不见！胡子，破铁皮！噢，对了！还有你！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "你们还在不知死活地寻找玉米卷吗？"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "天哪，你们可太不容易了。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "为了奖励你们，就让你们见识下我的古代魔法与现代科技结合的杰作！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "NPC_EXIT",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "他是谁来着？僵尸......哦！僵尸硕士！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "啊，用户戴夫，我在此纠正：他是僵尸博士，不是僵尸硕士。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "也许我们该掐个表，看看他这次能撑多久。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_EXIT",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_EXIT",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": ""
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "aliases": [
        "EditorFirstIntroNarrative"
      ]
    },
    {
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "你以为你赢了对吗？"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "但你不知道，一些可怕的事情正在发生！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "哈哈哈哈哈！敬请期待吧！你们马上就能见到一些“新东西”！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "他说话还蛮唬人的，哈哈哈哈。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "用户戴夫，也许他说的是真的。我们到其他时空后得加强防范。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_EXIT",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_EXIT",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": ""
            }
          },
